@Comment:	Chi eats with Mot , FAT , and Sis. Mot grills Chi on what she did in school , especially focusing on what she ate for lunch. Mot also asks about her new school and about her teacher. Fat says very little , presumably on instructions from Mot. Sis is hushed by Mot throughout; at one point she protests , vociferously demanding attention , and Mot momentarily turns off the recorder. Sis and Chi have a small argument about a movie; Chi says that it is scary but Sis insists that it is not real.
